WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.463
Week 13: City, Directions, and Public Services. ask for and give directions identify public services confirm a route

2
00:00:08.463 --> 00:00:15.775
Form and meaning. Ir a; location prepositions; informal commands for directions; seguir and doblar.

3
00:00:15.775 --> 00:00:40.219
Model set. Siga derecho hasta la plaza. Doble a la izquierda en la segunda esquina. ¿Voy bien para el ayuntamiento? Nos perdimos cerca de la estación. El banco queda enfrente del correo. Go straight to the plaza. Turn left at the second corner. Am I going the right way to city hall? We got lost near the station. The bank is across from the post office.

4
00:00:40.219 --> 00:00:50.349
Contrastive practice. Change the person, time, number, or level of formality in each model. Preserve the communicative purpose while the grammar changes.

5
00:00:50.349 --> 00:01:02.655
Production check. Say one original sentence for each function: ask for and give directions; identify public services; confirm a route. Then write it and compare the spoken and written forms.

6
00:01:02.655 --> 00:01:27.911
Model language. Siga derecho hasta la plaza. — Go straight to the plaza. Doble a la izquierda en la segunda esquina. — Turn left at the second corner. ¿Voy bien para el ayuntamiento? — Am I going the right way to city hall? Nos perdimos cerca de la estación. — We got lost near the station. El banco queda enfrente del correo. — The bank is across from the post office.

7
00:01:27.911 --> 00:01:37.659
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
